<title>USA: Group holds 5.3 pct ARI Network stake.</title>
<headline>Group holds 5.3 pct ARI Network stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including Applewood Associates L.P., a Brookville, N.Y., investment firm, said Wednesday it has acquired a 5.3 percent stake or 750,000 common sharesin ARI Network Services Inc.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it bought the stake on September 13 for $1.7 million or $2.25 a share.</p>
<p>It said it holds the stake for investment purposes.</p>
</text>
